## 5. Signal Output Schema

Fixed. No field may be added or removed without updating this document. PROMETHEUS depends on the exact structure.

```json
{
  "timestamp": "2026-04-21T14:30:00Z",
  "decision": "Strong Buy | Buy | Hold | Sell | Strong Sell | No Position",
  "asset": "BTC/USDT",
  "timeframe": "30m",
  "action": {
    "side": "buy",
    "type": "limit",
    "amount": "0.15",
    "price": "87250.00",
    "stop_loss": "85000.00",
    "take_profit": "92000.00"
  },
  "conviction": 184,
  "risk_level": "Medium",
  "weighted_breakdown": {
    "derivatives": 62,
    "onchain": 44,
    "technical": 38,
    "sentiment": 24,
    "context": 16,
    "total": 184
  },
  "provider_breakdown": {
    "coinalyze":    { "score": 81, "signal": "bullish", "status": "healthy" },
    "bitget":       { "score": 79, "signal": "bullish", "status": "healthy" },
    "hydra":        { "score": 74, "signal": "bullish", "status": "healthy" }
  },
  "reasoning_summary": "2–3 sentence synthesis of strongest convergences.",
  "key_convergences": ["Funding Z-score beyond 2.5 SD", "Liquidation cluster identified by HYDRA"],
  "key_risks": ["Resistance cluster at $89k", "Opposite-side cascade risk above"],
  "suggested_next_actions": ["Monitor 15m for entry refinement", "Re-run at next 30m close"]
}
```

**Rules:**

- `conviction`: integer 0–220
- `decision`: exactly one of the six permitted strings
- All money fields (amount, price, stop_loss, take_profit) serialize from `Decimal` — never from `float`
- `provider_breakdown` always present even if degraded; degraded providers show `status: "degraded"` and `score: 0`
- `action` populated only when decision is Buy / Strong Buy / Sell / Strong Sell; `{}` otherwise
- `timestamp` always UTC, ISO 8601

