## 16. OBTI (Order Book Toxicity Index)

OBTI is for PROMETHEUS's Execution Agent only, reading from Redis. It computes a rolling cancel-to-trade ratio over the top 10 price levels and yields directional toxicity (`obti_bid`, `obti_ask`) and Effective Liquidity. Pending design decisions (four outstanding questions on Bitget delta semantics where `size=0` = deletion, adaptive MAD-based thresholds vs. fixed 0.7 cutoff, and separation from HYDRA's VPIN calculator) must be resolved before the session prompt is written. **Do not implement OBTI until those four questions are answered.**

